BT /F2 18.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 85.96 785.89 Tm (Workforce & Machine Live Monitoring System) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 200.92 763.89 Tm (User Manual and Operating Guide) Tj ET
0.60 0.60 0.60 RG 0.70 w 56.00 747.89 m 539.28 747.89 l S
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 735.89 Tm (This manual explains how to install, log in to, and operate the Workforce & Machine Live) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 722.39 Tm (Monitoring System: a web-based, password-protected dashboard for tracking daily workforce) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 708.89 Tm (numbers and machine status across your plant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 695.39 Tm (It is intended for everyday users \(operators, supervisors and managers\) as well as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 681.89 Tm (administrators who manage accounts and access. No programming knowledge is required to use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 668.39 Tm (the system.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 654.89 Tm (1. Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 636.89 Tm (The system is a single web application that several people can use at the same time. Each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 623.39 Tm (person signs in with their own username and password. Whatever one user records \(a workforce) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 609.89 Tm (count, a machine status, or a production run\) is saved to a shared database and appears live) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 596.39 Tm (for everyone else.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 582.89 Tm (Key features) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 567.89 Tm (- Live dashboard that automatically refreshes \(every 15 seconds\) so the numbers are always) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 554.39 Tm (  current.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 540.89 Tm (- Daily workforce records: total workforce plus the Metex, CSK, TopQuality, BestCare and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 527.39 Tm (  Prestige teams, staff on leave, and loading staff.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 513.89 Tm (- Machine status tracking: Running, Break Down, Maintenance and Idle, with running and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 500.39 Tm (  out-of-order machine counts and names.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 486.89 Tm (- An easy update form to create or edit any date and shift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 473.39 Tm (- Workforce history that shows the current month by default, with a month picker to review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 459.89 Tm (  past or future months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 446.39 Tm (- A Production Run Console to start and stop production runs and to start or stop many) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 432.89 Tm (  machines at once \(bulk actions\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 419.39 Tm (- Management pages for machines, product groups, products, reports and users, plus a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 405.89 Tm (  machine time-summary page for administrators.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 392.39 Tm (- Responsive design that works on desktop, tablet and mobile.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 378.89 Tm (2. System Requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 360.89 Tm (- Python 3.9 or newer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 347.39 Tm (- A modern web browser \(Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 333.89 Tm (- For production: a PostgreSQL database. For quick local testing, no extra database is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 320.39 Tm (  needed \(SQLite is used automatically\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 306.89 Tm (- Optional, for sharing over the internet: the Cloudflare Tunnel client \(cloudflared\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 293.39 Tm (3. Installation and Setup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 275.39 Tm (Follow these steps once, on the computer that will host the system.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 261.89 Tm (Step 1 - Install dependencies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 246.89 Tm (Open a terminal in the project folder and run:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 233.39 Tm (pip install -r requirements.txt) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 219.89 Tm (Step 2 - Configure the environment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 204.89 Tm (Copy the example configuration and then edit the new .env file:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 191.39 Tm (cp .env.example .env) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 177.89 Tm (Set at least these three values in .env:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 164.39 Tm (- DATABASE_URL - your database connection string. For PostgreSQL use something like) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 150.89 Tm (  postgresql://postgres:PASSWORD@localhost:5432/workforce. For a quick local test use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 137.39 Tm (  sqlite:///workforce.db.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 123.89 Tm (- DASHBOARD_PASSWORD - the password users type to sign in.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 110.39 Tm (- SECRET_KEY - a long random string used to keep login sessions secure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 96.89 Tm (Step 3 - Start the application) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 81.89 Tm (Run the application with:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 269.04 30 Tm (Page 1 of 5) Tj ET

endstream
endobj
