BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 785.89 Tm (python app.py) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 772.39 Tm (Step 4 - Open it in a browser) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 757.39 Tm (Visit http://localhost:5000 . On first start the app creates the database tables and seeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 743.89 Tm (default users and sample data.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 730.39 Tm (4. Logging In) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 712.39 Tm (Open the application URL. You see a login screen with three fields:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 698.89 Tm (- Role - choose the role your account was created with.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 685.39 Tm (- Username - your account username.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 671.89 Tm (- Password - your account password.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 658.39 Tm (The role you select must match the role of the account, otherwise you will see an error.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 644.89 Tm (After a successful login you are taken to your dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 631.39 Tm (Default accounts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 616.39 Tm (When the database is empty, the system creates these starter accounts \(change their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 602.89 Tm (passwords after first login\):) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 589.39 Tm (- admin / admin123  \(Administrator\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 575.89 Tm (- supervisor / super123  \(Supervisor\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 562.39 Tm (- operator / oper123  \(Operator\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 548.89 Tm (Signing out) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 533.89 Tm (Use the user menu in the top corner to log out. Always log out on shared computers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 520.39 Tm (5. Roles and Page Access) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 502.39 Tm (Not every user can see every page. Each user belongs to a role and has a list of pages they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 488.89 Tm (are allowed to open. This is enforced on the server, so even typing a page address directly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 475.39 Tm (will show a Forbidden \(403\) message if the user has no access.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 461.89 Tm (Available roles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 446.89 Tm (- Administrator - full access to every page and settings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 433.39 Tm (- General Manager, Operation Manager, Production Manager - all pages by default; an admin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 419.89 Tm (  can narrow their access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 406.39 Tm (- Supervisor - dashboard, machines, products, groups, reports, run console, workforce and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 392.89 Tm (  production runs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 379.39 Tm (- Operator - dashboard, machines, run console and production runs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 365.89 Tm (- Viewer - read-only: dashboard, machines, products, groups, reports, workforce and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 352.39 Tm (  production runs.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 338.89 Tm (How access appears in the interface) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 323.89 Tm (The left navigation sidebar only shows the pages a user is allowed to open. User Management) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 310.39 Tm (is visible only to administrators. If a page is missing for you, ask an administrator to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 296.89 Tm (grant access.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 283.39 Tm (6. Navigating the Interface) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 265.39 Tm (Sidebar navigation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 250.39 Tm (The sidebar lists the pages you can access. On a phone it becomes a slide-out drawer that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 236.89 Tm (you open with a menu button.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 223.39 Tm (Global date and shift filters) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 208.39 Tm (The top of the page has Date and Shift \(Day / Night\) filters. These apply to the pages that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 194.89 Tm (use them, such as the dashboard and the workforce board, so you can focus on a specific day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 181.39 Tm (and shift. A 'Today' control jumps the date back to the current day.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 167.89 Tm (Live updates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 152.89 Tm (The dashboard refreshes itself automatically every 15 seconds. Most other pages also) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 139.39 Tm (re-fetch their data after you make a change, and many have a Refresh button.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 125.89 Tm (7. Page-by-Page Guide) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 107.89 Tm (Dashboard \(home\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 92.89 Tm (The landing page shows live key indicators such as running and out-of-order machine counts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 79.39 Tm (recent records and summary widgets. It updates on its own every 15 seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 269.04 30 Tm (Page 2 of 5) Tj ET

endstream
