BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 785.89 Tm (Machines) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 770.89 Tm (View, add, edit and remove machines. For each machine you can set its status \(Running, Break) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 757.39 Tm (Down, Maintenance or Idle\) and link it to a group and product.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 743.89 Tm (Groups and Products) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 728.89 Tm (Groups organize your products. Use the Groups page to manage product groups and the Products) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 715.39 Tm (page to manage the products inside them. These are used when starting a production run.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 701.89 Tm (Reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 686.89 Tm (Shows the history of machine status changes \(who changed what and when\), with filters for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 673.39 Tm (date range, machine and status. Results can be exported.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 659.89 Tm (Run Console \(Production Run Console\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 644.89 Tm (This is where production runs are started and stopped:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 631.39 Tm (- Start a Production Run: choose a machine, a product group, a product, and optionally an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 617.89 Tm (  item name, item code and note, then click Start Run.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 604.39 Tm (- Live Runs: currently running productions appear in a grid with a Stop control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 590.89 Tm (- Recent Runs: a table of past and current runs with their status and run time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 577.39 Tm (- Bulk Machine Actions: the 'Start All Machines' and 'Stop All Machines' buttons open a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 563.89 Tm (  single form where you pick the new status and shift and choose which machines \(via) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 550.39 Tm (  checkboxes\), then submit. These buttons are visible to anyone who can open the Run) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 536.89 Tm (  Console page.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 523.39 Tm (Workforce Board) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 508.39 Tm (Used to record and review daily workforce numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 494.89 Tm (- KPI cards show Total Workforce, Metex, CSK, TopQuality, BestCare, Prestige, Staff On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 481.39 Tm (  Leave and Loading Staff. Click a card to see its breakdown.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 467.89 Tm (- Update Workforce: pick a Date and Shift \(Day or Night\), enter the counts \(including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 454.39 Tm (  staff-on-leave count and names, and loading staff count and names\), then Save.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 440.89 Tm (- Workforce History: shows the current month by default. Use the Month picker to switch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 427.39 Tm (  months and the shift toggle to filter Day or Night. Records are listed newest first.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 413.89 Tm (Production Runs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 398.89 Tm (A full list of production runs with their machine, group, product, item, operator, run time,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 385.39 Tm (machine status and run status. Use the search and filters to find specific runs.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 371.89 Tm (User Management \(administrators only\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 356.89 Tm (Create and edit user accounts: username, password \(minimum 4 characters\), display name, role) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 343.39 Tm (and active/inactive status. You can also set each user's page permissions with checkboxes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 329.89 Tm (New users start with the default permissions for their role; administrators get every page.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 316.39 Tm (Summary \(administrators only\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 301.39 Tm (A machine-wise time summary showing how long each machine spent running, idle, in breakdown) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 287.89 Tm (and in maintenance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 274.39 Tm (8. Recording Daily Workforce Data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 256.39 Tm (A typical daily entry:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 242.89 Tm (- Open the Workforce Board from the sidebar.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 229.39 Tm (- Set the Date \(use 'Today' for the current day\) and choose the Shift \(Day or Night\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 215.89 Tm (- Enter the Total Workforce and the sub-team counts: Metex, CSK, TopQuality, BestCare and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 202.39 Tm (  Prestige.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 188.89 Tm (- Enter Staff On Leave \(a count and, in the separate field, the comma-separated names\) and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 175.39 Tm (  Loading Staff \(count and names\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 161.89 Tm (- Click Save Workforce. The KPI cards update and the record appears in the history for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 148.39 Tm (  that date and shift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 134.89 Tm (- Review the month using the history Month picker; switch the shift toggle to see Day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 121.39 Tm (  versus Night entries.) Tj ET
