BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 785.89 Tm (- Select the Machine, Product Group and Product. Add an item name, item code and note if) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 772.39 Tm (  needed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 758.89 Tm (- Click Start Run. The run appears immediately under Live Runs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 745.39 Tm (To stop a run, use the Stop control on its Live Run card or row. The machine's open run is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 731.89 Tm (closed automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 718.39 Tm (To act on many machines at once, use Start All Machines or Stop All Machines, choose the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 704.89 Tm (machines in the modal, set the status and shift, and submit. Production runs are kept in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 691.39 Tm (sync with the new machine status.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 677.89 Tm (10. Managing Users and Permissions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 659.89 Tm (Administrators manage who can use the system:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 646.39 Tm (- Open User Management \(visible only to admins\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 632.89 Tm (- Add a user with a username, password, display name, role and active flag.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 619.39 Tm (- Set page permissions with the checkboxes. The role's default pages are filled in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 605.89 Tm (  automatically; you can allow or restrict individual pages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 592.39 Tm (- Disable a user \(set inactive\) to block sign-in without deleting their history.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 578.89 Tm (11. Remote Access \(Sharing Over the Internet\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 560.89 Tm (The app listens on port 5000 on all network interfaces, so other computers on the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 547.39 Tm (network can reach it directly. To share it with people anywhere without changing routers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 533.89 Tm (use a Cloudflare Tunnel:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 520.39 Tm (- Start the server \(python app.py\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 506.89 Tm (- In a second terminal run: cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:5000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 493.39 Tm (- Cloudflared prints a public HTTPS address. Share that link and the DASHBOARD_PASSWORD) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 479.89 Tm (  with your users.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 466.39 Tm (The random address changes each time you restart the tunnel; create a named tunnel \(free) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 452.89 Tm (Cloudflare account\) for a fixed address. Your computer must stay on for the link to work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 439.39 Tm (12. Security Notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 421.39 Tm (- Never set DEBUG=True when the app is reachable from the internet; the debug console) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 407.89 Tm (  allows remote code execution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 394.39 Tm (- Use a strong DASHBOARD_PASSWORD and a random SECRET_KEY in .env.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 380.89 Tm (- Control who can do what through roles and per-page permissions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 367.39 Tm (- All users share one database, so recorded data is visible to everyone who has access to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 353.89 Tm (  the relevant page.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 340.39 Tm (13. Troubleshooting and FAQ) Tj ET
